日は選抜発表がありましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしはアンダーメンバーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず皆さんに言いたいことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『悔しい涙は流さない。』と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶろぐでは書きましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっと堪えていたのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"溢れてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約束破ってしまい本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり涙のコントロールって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと毎回握手会やぶろぐで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくださってる皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く申し訳なくて言葉が出ません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その収録があった日には1日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっぷり泣いたので今はもう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッキリしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にこのブログを書いていると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の涙が分からない涙が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てきてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもポジティブに考えれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと選抜にいさせてもらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の実力と見合ってるか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということすら考える時間が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なく。